    <string name="about_title">About</string>
    <string name="about_body">An offline badge collection manager for badges you physically own.\n\nOnce you read your own badge card, its link is kept on this device so you can hand the effect back to the game without digging the card out again. The link is only ever read from your own card: this app never writes to a card, never emulates one, never imports links from anywhere else, and never uploads anything.\n\nIt has no INTERNET permission at all.</string>
